        "en": "Pet owners overwhelmingly praise the veterinary surgeons, nursing staff, and receptionists at Martin Vets in Kirkintilloch. Reviewers repeatedly highlight the team's polite and friendly manner, noting that staff listen carefully to owner concerns and communicate with great empathy. Clients feel reassured by the team's attentiveness and approachable support during appointments."
