      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently remark on how gently their dogs, cats, and small animals are treated during examinations and procedures. Reviewers note that veterinary staff make deliberate efforts to soothe anxious or nervous pets, offering treats and speaking calmly to keep visits stress-free. Owners appreciate that their animals are handled with genuine care and affection."
      }
    },
